start: mr
R1: 3ch=tr {2tr 3ch [3tr 3ch]x3}@ring ss@top
R2: 3ch=tr ch [{3tr 3ch 3tr}@sp ch]x3 {3tr 3ch 2tr}@sp ss@top
R3: 3ch=tr 2tr@same ch [{3tr 3ch 3tr}@corner ch 3tr@sp ch]x3 {3tr 3ch 3tr}@corner ch ss@top
R4: 3ch=tr ch 3tr@sp ch [{3tr 3ch 3tr}@corner ch 3tr@sp ch 3tr@sp ch]x3 {3tr 3ch 3tr}@corner ch 2tr@sp ss@top
